{"seq":1,"slug":"hamming-code","title":"汉明码","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-code","wordCount":1931,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"汉明码\">汉明码</h1><p>&quot;汉明码&quot;（Hamming code）是理查德·汉明 1950 年发表的纠错码，也是历史上第一种能够<strong>自动纠正</strong>单比特错误的编码方案。它首次实现了&quot;机器在不重传的前提下自我修复数据&quot;，把&quot;检错&quot;推进到&quot;纠错&quot;，奠定了整个纠错码（error-correcting code, ECC）领域。汉明本人凭借这项工作（连同数值方法与自动编码系统）于 1968 年获得图灵奖，是该奖第三位得主——引文为&quot;For his work on numerical methods, automatic coding systems, and error-detecting and error-correcting codes&quot;（来源：<a href=\"https://amturing.acm.org/award_winners/hamming_1000652.cfm\">A.M. Turing Award Laureate</a>）。</p>\n<p>本篇聚焦汉明码本身的构造与编解码机制；衡量码字差异、决定纠错能力的数学工具见 <a href=\"../error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance\">海明距离</a>；汉明码进入硬件与通信的产业化影响见 <a href=\"../../major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/the-error-correcting-revolution\">纠错革命</a> 与 <a href=\"../../major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/applications\">应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>汉明码之所以是&quot;历史上第一种能自动纠错的编码&quot;，靠的不是更复杂的电路，而是三个彼此咬合的设计概念。先把它们讲清楚，再看后面的构造细节。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冗余定位错误，而非重复</strong>：奇偶校验只能回答&quot;有没有错&quot;；汉明码用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 个校验位联合编码出&quot;错在第几位&quot;这个<strong>地址</strong>，因此能定位并修复，而不只是报警。</li>\n<li><strong>校正子即地址</strong>：解码时重算校验得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 位校正子（syndrome），它的数值直接就是出错位置的二进制编号。纠错由此退化为一次&quot;查号取反&quot;，无需搜索、无需重传。</li>\n<li><strong>距离决定能力</strong>：一种码能检几位、纠几位，完全由码字间最小海明距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 可纠 1 位，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 可纠 1 位并检出 2 位）。汉明码的一切工程变体（如 SEC-DED）都是在这条判据上做取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三个概念共同解释了汉明码的持久性：它用最少的冗余，把&quot;纠错&quot;从人工重跑变成了机器的内建能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"问题的缘起-贝尔实验室的周末崩溃\">问题的缘起：贝尔实验室的周末崩溃</h2><p>汉明码不是纯理论推演的产物，而是被一台不可靠的机器逼出来的。1940 年代末，汉明在贝尔实验室使用 Bell Model V 继电器计算机。这类机器带有奇偶校验（parity check），一旦读到错误的比特就<strong>停机</strong>，把后续作业丢弃。汉明常在周五提交批处理作业、周末无人值守运行，周一回来却发现机器在中途因一个比特翻转而停机，整批计算前功尽弃。</p>\n<p>奇偶校验的局限正是切入点：它只能&quot;发现有错&quot;，却既不知错在哪一位、也无法修复，只能让机器罢工。汉明的质问是：&quot;既然机器能检测到出错，为什么不能让它顺手把错改对？&quot;（这段经历被广泛记录，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Hamming\">Richard Hamming - Wikipedia</a>）。这一从&quot;检错&quot;到&quot;纠错&quot;的跨越，就是汉明码的全部出发点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>冗余开销</th>\n<th>出错时行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无校验</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>错误悄然传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇偶校验（parity）</td>\n<td>检 1 位错</td>\n<td>1 位</td>\n<td>停机/丢弃，需人工重跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三倍冗余（重复 3 次）</td>\n<td>纠 1 位错</td>\n<td>200%</td>\n<td>多数表决，开销巨大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汉明码 (7,4)</td>\n<td>纠 1 位错</td>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>自动定位并翻转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"纠错的原理-用校验位编码-出错位置\">纠错的原理：用校验位编码&quot;出错位置&quot;</h2><p>汉明码的核心洞见是：<strong>让若干校验位联合编码出&quot;错误发生在第几位&quot;这个地址</strong>。以经典的汉明码 (7,4) 为例——7 位码字中 4 位是数据、3 位是校验。校验位放在 2 的幂次位置（第 1、2、4 位），数据位填其余位置（第 3、5、6、7 位）。每个校验位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖位号二进制中对应比特为 1 的所有位置：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 = d_3 \\oplus d_5 \\oplus d_7,\\quad p_2 = d_3 \\oplus d_6 \\oplus d_7,\\quad p_4 = d_5 \\oplus d_6 \\oplus d_7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>解码时重新计算三个校验，得到一个 3 位的&quot;校正子&quot;（syndrome）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = s_4 s_2 s_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。其值正是出错位置的二进制编号：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示无错，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>（二进制 101）表示第 5 位翻转——直接把第 5 位取反即可修复。这种&quot;校正子即地址&quot;的设计极其优雅，把纠错变成了一次查表取反。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  D[&quot;4 位数据 d3 d5 d6 d7&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;计算校验 p1 p2 p4&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; C[&quot;7 位码字 p1 p2 d3 p4 d5 d6 d7&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|信道/存储, 1 位翻转| R[&quot;接收码字&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; S[&quot;重算校验 → 校正子 s&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|s = 0| OK[&quot;无错, 取出数据&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|s = k| FIX[&quot;翻转第 k 位 → 取出数据&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  D[\"4 位数据 d3 d5 d6 d7\"] --&gt; E[\"计算校验 p1 p2 p4\"]\n  E --&gt; C[\"7 位码字 p1 p2 d3 p4 d5 d6 d7\"]\n  C --&gt;|信道/存储, 1 位翻转| R[\"接收码字\"]\n  R --&gt; S[\"重算校验 → 校正子 s\"]\n  S --&gt;|s = 0| OK[\"无错, 取出数据\"]\n  S --&gt;|s = k| FIX[\"翻转第 k 位 → 取出数据\"]</pre><p>一般化的汉明码 (n, k) 要满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^r \\ge k + r + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8004em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=n-k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为校验位数），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 个校验位的校正子必须能编码&quot;无错&quot;加上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个可能的出错位置（来源：<a href=\"https://zoo.cs.yale.edu/classes/cs323/doc/Hamming.pdf\">Hamming 原始论文 PDF, BSTJ 1950</a>）。常见族成员有 (7,4)、(15,11)、(31,26)——位数越多，校验开销占比越低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sec-ded-再加一位的工程权衡\">SEC-DED：再加一位的工程权衡</h2><p>朴素的汉明码 (7,4) 只能纠 1 位错，且遇到 2 位错时会&quot;自信地纠错&quot;反而越改越糟。汉明在论文中给出的实用扩展是再加一个总体奇偶位，得到 SEC-DED（Single Error Correction, Double Error Detection，单纠双检）——例如 (8,4) 或工程中常用的 (72,64)。其判据是码字间最小海明距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\min}=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>最小海明距离</th>\n<th>检错能力</th>\n<th>纠错能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>检 1 位</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3（汉明码 SEC）</td>\n<td>检 2 位</td>\n<td>纠 1 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4（SEC-DED）</td>\n<td>检 2 位</td>\n<td>纠 1 位 + 报告&quot;双错不可纠&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个&quot;多花 1 位换取双错告警&quot;的取舍，正是汉明码至今仍是服务器内存（ECC RAM 普遍用 (72,64) SEC-DED）首选的原因——它在硬件成本与可靠性之间取得了极佳平衡。最小海明距离与纠错能力的完整关系，详见 <a href=\"../error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance\">海明距离</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与边界-汉明码不是万能的\">反模式与边界：汉明码不是万能的</h2><p>理解汉明码的关键是认清它的适用边界，避免误用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>只擅长随机单点错，怕突发错（burst error）</strong>：若噪声导致连续多位同时翻转，汉明码会失效。对付突发错需要 Reed-Solomon 等更强的码（CD、QR 码、卫星通信用的就是它），或先用交织（interleaving）把突发错打散成随机错。</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;宁可不纠，不可乱纠&quot;</strong>：超出纠错能力时，SEC 码会把 2 位错误&quot;纠&quot;成第 3 个错误的码字，造成静默数据损坏。这正是生产系统坚持用 SEC-DED 而非纯 SEC 的根本原因。</li>\n<li><strong>不是压缩，是加冗余</strong>：汉明码靠增加冗余换可靠性，与数据压缩目标相反，不能指望它省空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"开创性与深远影响\">开创性与深远影响</h2><p>在汉明之前，可靠性靠重传与人工；汉明码第一次让&quot;自我修复&quot;成为机器的内建能力，开辟了编码理论这一分支。后续的 Reed-Muller 码、Reed-Solomon 码、BCH 码、乃至现代的 LDPC 码与 Polar 码（5G 控制信道采用），都站在这条由汉明开启的道路上。今天它的身影无处不在：服务器 ECC 内存、NAND 闪存控制器、深空通信、二维码——纠错码已是信息社会&quot;看不见的地基&quot;。这条产业化脉络在 <a href=\"../../major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/the-error-correcting-revolution\">纠错革命</a> 中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>汉明码源于贝尔实验室周末无人值守时继电器机因 1 位错停机、整批作业作废的实际痛点，把思路从&quot;检错&quot;推进到&quot;纠错&quot;。</li>\n<li>核心机制是用校验位联合编码出错位置的地址，校正子直接给出错位编号，纠错退化为查表取反；(7,4) 码即 4 数据位加 3 校验位。</li>\n<li>一般化条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^r \\ge k + r + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8004em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，常见族有 (7,4)、(15,11)、(31,26)；工程上用 SEC-DED（如 (72,64)）再加一位以换取双错告警，是服务器 ECC 内存的首选。</li>\n<li>边界是只擅长随机单点错：突发错、2 位错都需要更强的码（Reed-Solomon）或先做交织。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"汉明码","id":"汉明码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题的缘起：贝尔实验室的周末崩溃","id":"问题的缘起-贝尔实验室的周末崩溃"},{"level":2,"text":"纠错的原理：用校验位编码\"出错位置\"","id":"纠错的原理-用校验位编码-出错位置"},{"level":2,"text":"SEC-DED：再加一位的工程权衡","id":"sec-ded-再加一位的工程权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与边界：汉明码不是万能的","id":"反模式与边界-汉明码不是万能的"},{"level":2,"text":"开创性与深远影响","id":"开创性与深远影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"海明距离","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance"}}